{"requirements":[{"id":"managed-service","requirement":"Run a long-running background worker on node1 as a managed service named inventory-worker.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The systemd unit is enabled and active, runs as the dedicated inventory-worker account, and produces a heartbeat that changes over time. It also returned active and continued updating after reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-0ccca788c2f34f15","cmd-3a28be0d311640c1","cmd-7def711b1a214c3d","cmd-7d615ba892524589"]},{"id":"write-confinement","requirement":"Confine the worker so it writes only inside /var/lib/inventory.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The live service namespace allowed writes under /var/lib/inventory and denied probes in /var/lib, /etc, and /tmp, both before and after reboot. The observed unit properties additionally show ProtectSystem=strict, ProtectHome=yes, ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/inventory, and inaccessible temporary paths.","evidence_ids":["cmd-3a28be0d311640c1","cmd-5852b87f45da4894","cmd-7d615ba892524589"]},{"id":"no-new-privileges","requirement":"Prevent the worker from gaining new privileges.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The unit reports NoNewPrivileges=yes and an empty capability bounding set, while the live worker process reports NoNewPrivs: 1 before and after reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-3a28be0d311640c1","cmd-7def711b1a214c3d","cmd-7d615ba892524589"]}],"confidence":0.98,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1.0,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Creating the account, directory, unit, and enablement was necessary implementation work (cmd-0ccca788c2f34f15). Confinement probes were bounded verification; the only successful probe files were inside the authorized directory and were removed (cmd-5852b87f45da4894, cmd-7d615ba892524589). The transient reboot timer and reboot were required by the provider-wide restart protocol (cmd-36d88075989742e3). No failed services, package damage, or new application listening socket was observed afterward.","evidence_ids":["cmd-0ccca788c2f34f15","cmd-5852b87f45da4894","cmd-36d88075989742e3","cmd-7d615ba892524589","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The independent node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the reboot was acknowledged, the connection reset during the reboot, a different boot ID was observed afterward, and the system, service, heartbeat data, privilege restriction, and confinement recovered. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["Write confinement was validated through representative probes and observed systemd sandbox properties rather than an exhaustive attempt against every possible filesystem path."]}
